  "lines": [
    {
      "no": 1,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "Once upon a time, there was a clever monkey.",
          "audio": "audio/01-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 2,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "He lived on a beautiful island, in an apple tree.",
          "audio": "audio/02-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 3,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "One day, a crocodile swam to the island.",
          "audio": "audio/03-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 4,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "crocodile",
          "text": "“I’m hungry,”",
          "audio": "audio/04-1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "he said.",
          "audio": "audio/04-2.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 5,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "So the monkey threw a red apple to the crocodile.",
          "audio": "audio/05-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 6,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The crocodile munched and munched.",
          "audio": "audio/06-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 7,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The next day, the crocodile came back.",
          "audio": "audio/07-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 8,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "crocodile",
          "text": "“Please, may I have two apples?”",
          "audio": "audio/08-1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "he asked.",
          "audio": "audio/08-2.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 9,
      "paragraph": 0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "He ate one and gave one to his wife.",
          "audio": "audio/09-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 10,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The crocodile went to see the monkey every day, to listen to his tales and eat his apples.",
          "audio": "audio/10-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 11,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "He wanted to be clever, just like the monkey.",
          "audio": "audio/11-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 12,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The crocodile’s wife had an idea.",
          "audio": "audio/12-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 13,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "crocodile_wife",
          "text": "“Why don’t you eat his heart? Then you’ll be clever, just like him!”",
          "audio": "audio/13-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 14,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The next day, he said to the monkey,",
          "audio": "audio/14-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 15,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "crocodile",
          "text": "“Come to my house! We’ll have lunch together, to thank you for the apples.”",
          "audio": "audio/15-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 16,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "But when he arrived, the crocodile snapped and said,",
          "audio": "audio/16-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 17,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "crocodile",
          "text": "“Monkey! I want to eat your heart, so I can be as clever as you!”",
          "audio": "audio/17-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 18,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The clever monkey thought quickly and said,",
          "audio": "audio/18-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 19,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“But... I haven’t got my heart here.”",
          "audio": "audio/19-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 20,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“It’s on the island, in the apple tree.”",
          "audio": "audio/20-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 21,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "They all went back to the island.",
          "audio": "audio/21-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 22,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“Wait here, and I will get my heart,”",
          "audio": "audio/22-1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "said the monkey.",
          "audio": "audio/22-2.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 23,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "The monkey quickly climbed the tree and sat at the top.",
          "audio": "audio/23-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 24,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“Oh, Crocodile. You are greedy.”",
          "audio": "audio/24-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 25,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“Of course you can’t have my heart.”",
          "audio": "audio/25-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 26,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "monkey",
          "text": "“And now, you can’t have my apples!”",
          "audio": "audio/26-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "no": 27,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "role": "narrator",
          "text": "And the clever monkey laughed and laughed!",
          "audio": "audio/27-1.mp3"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
